{"seq":3,"slug":"pipeline-integration","title":"管道集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-data-testing","title":"CI/CD 中的数据测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/ci-cd-data-testing","wordCount":1089,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"streaming-quality-realtime","title":"流式数据质量实时监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/streaming-quality-realtime","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-contract-testing","title":"Schema 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/schema-contract-testing","wordCount":1176,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 管道集成\n\n本章解决数据质量测试的\"最后一公里\"：如何将质量检查无缝嵌入数据管道的各个环节。CI/CD 集成确保代码变更不会引入数据质量回归，流式监控将质量检查从批处理扩展到实时场景，Schema 契约测试则在数据生产者与消费者之间建立可验证的接口合同。\n\n三篇文档按数据流动的时序展开：开发阶段（CI/CD）、运行时（流式处理）、接口层（Schema 契约）。它们共同构成一个防御纵深体系——在数据可能出错的每个环节都设置质量关卡。\n"}